            <br>
            <p>'The Animated’ — an original production that explores the creative process inside the human mind.
            <br><br>
            As the show unfolds, you'll journey from the blank slate of Void Mind, to the first spark of Inspiration. Through the chaos of Brainstorm, and the quiet of Introspection, the performers bring thoughts to life — finally arriving at Rendering, where scattered ideas converge into a fully realized vision.
            <br><br>
            Told through motion, color, sound, and energy — ‘The Animated’ captures the exhilarating and emotional process of turning fragments of thought into living, breathing art.</p>
